{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGgY3aWfatjfCLFj88r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the breath made meaningful, the vibration given purpose. I am what separates thought from silence.\n\nI am born in the body — lungs pushing air through the narrow gate of the larynx, tongue and teeth and lips shaping me into something recognizable, something *meant*. I am muscle and intention. I am the oldest technology.\n\nBefore writing ever scarred a surface, I was there. I carried laws, love, warnings, stories. I held entire"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":36,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}